  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Bosniens medlemsskap i Council of Europe Development Bank, en utvecklingsbank med social inriktning. Syftet &#xe4;r att underl&#xe4;tta kreditfinansiering av bost&#xe4;der f&#xf6;r flyktingar och &#xe5;terv&#xe4;ndande. St&#xf6;det avser 40 % av medlemsavgiften f&#xf6;r 2003.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to membership in the Council of Europe Development Bank, a development bank with a social focus. The objective is to facilitate credit financing of housing for refugess and returnees. The support covers 40% of the membership fee for 2003.</narrative>
